#import "../template.typ": comparison, evidence-card, photo-panel

== Purpose and audience
Describe an actual activity, its date, intended audience, and objective.
Explain what students planned and led, and name partners only with approval.

#photo-panel[
  Replace with an approved event photo and a factual caption.
  Confirm permission before publishing identifiable students or attendees.
]

#comparison[
  === Student contribution
  Explain who planned, presented, mentored, or followed up.
  Describe how students practiced leadership or learned a new skill.
][
  === Impact and follow-up
  Distinguish attendance from outcomes.
  Explain how feedback was collected and what the team changed afterward.
]

#evidence-card("Evidence to supply")[
  Add verified participation counts, feedback, or follow-up results.
  Record how each count was collected and avoid double-counting repeat visits.
]

== Team development
Describe how the activity supports mentoring, knowledge transfer, or
the team's longer-term plan. Link the supporting season record.
